OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as motorcyclist seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in A45 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist was seriously injured in a
OL,8,Fcrash on the A45 in Northamptonshire.
OL,10,FThe collision involved a black Mini
OL,11,FCountryman and a green Lexmoto
OL,12,Fmotorcycle close to Raunds, at about
OL,13,F13:30 BST on Saturday, said police.
OL,15,FThe rider of the motorbike, a man aged
OL,16,Fin his 20s, was taken to hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
